[14.515406, "o", "eattach vmctl-t-parallels-ide-ov --storagectl IDE Controller --port 0 --device 1 --type hdd --medium C:\\vagrant-storage-labs\\vms\\vmctl-t-parallels-ide-ov\\vmctl-t-parallels-ide-ov_data.hdd\r\r\n      8: VBoxManage modifyvm vmctl-t-parallels-ide-ov --boot1 disk\r\r\n      9: VBoxManage modifyvm vmctl-t-parallels-ide-ov --boot2 dvd\r\r\n     10: VBoxManage modifyvm vmctl-t-parallels-ide-ov --boot3 none\r\r\n     11: VBoxManage modifyvm vmctl-t-parallels-ide-ov --boot4 none\r\r\n  Overrides applied:\r\r\n    storage[1].name = 'data' (from --add-disk)\r\r\n    storage[1].size_mb = 100 (from --add-disk)\r\r\n    storage[1].bus = 'ide' (from --add-disk)\r\r\n    storage[1].format = 'parallels' (from --add-disk)\r\r\n    memory.mb = 256 (from --set, was 128)\r\r\n    cpu.count = 2 (from --set, was 1)\r\r\n    name = 'vmctl-t-parallels-ide-ov' (from --new-name, was 'vmctl-t-parallels-ide')\r\r\n  Warning: more than one CPU is configured but ioapic is off; an x86 guest needs an I/O APIC to use them, and virtualbox will not give it one\r\r\n  -> exit 0\r\r\n  [ok] the overridden VM is created\r\r\n$ vmctl -p virtualbox read vmctl-t-parallels-ide-ov --format json\r\r\n  {\r\r\n    \"name\": \"vmctl-t-parallels-ide-ov\",\r\r\n    \"arch\": \"x86_64\",\r\r\n    \"machine\": null,\r\r\n    \"guest_os\": \"ubuntu\",\r\r\n    \"description\": null,\r\r\n    \"cpu\": {\r\r\n      \"count\": 2,\r\r\n      \"hotplug\": false,\r\r\n      \"execution_cap\": 100,\r\r\n      \"pae\": false,\r\r\n      \"nested_virt\": false,\r\r\n      \"sockets\": null,\r\r\n      \"cores\": null,\r\r\n      \"threads\": null,\r\r\n      \"model\": null\r\r\n    },\r\r\n    \"memory\": {\r\r\n      \"mb\": 256,\r\r\n      \"vram_mb\": 16,\r\r\n      \"page_fusion\": false,\r\r\n      \"ballooning\": false\r\r\n    },\r\r\n    \"firmware\": {\r\r\n      \"type\": \"bios\",\r\r\n      \"secure_boot\": false,\r\r\n      \"tpm\": false\r\r\n    },\r\r\n    \"storage\": [\r\r\n      {\r\r\n        \"name\": \"disk_IDE Controller_0_0\",\r\r\n        \"kind\": \"disk\",\r\r\n        \"bus\": \"ide\",\r\r\n        \"controller\": \"ide0\",\r\r\n        \"slot\": 0,\r\r\n        \"unit\": 0,\r\r\n        \"size_mb\": 100,\r\r\n        \"format\": \"parallels\",\r\r\n        \"allocation\": \"thin\",\r\r\n        \"readonly\": false,\r\r\n  -> exit 0\r\r\n  [ok] the VM reads back as JSON\r\r\n  [ok] the memory override reached the hypervisor -- reported 256 MB\r\r\n  [ok] the CPU override reached the hypervisor -- reported 2"]
